%% Phase 2 sequence models (planned). Details such as window length are tuned in Phase 2.
flowchart TB
    NORM["Regime-normalized sensors<br/>fitted on training engines"]:::fit
    WIN["Fixed-length windows<br/>inside one engine<br/>label = RUL at last cycle"]:::planned

    subgraph NET["One network per encoder, trained by the shared trainer (seeding · early stopping · checkpoints)"]
        LSTM["LSTM"]:::planned
        TCN["Temporal CNN"]:::planned
        TRF["Transformer encoder"]:::planned
        HEAD["Regression head"]:::planned
        LSTM --> HEAD
        TCN --> HEAD
        TRF --> HEAD
    end

    EVAL["Same folds and metrics<br/>as Phase 1; each test<br/>engine scored once,<br/>on its last window"]:::output

    NORM --> WIN
    WIN --> LSTM
    WIN --> TCN
    WIN --> TRF
    HEAD -- RUL --> EVAL

